      "answer": "No",
      "reason_rejected": "This would require assuming that uninsured individuals are less sensitive to cost or that insurance status has no impact on the decision to accept care. This contradicts robust empirical evidence showing that financial barriers are a leading cause of underutilization of diagnostic services among the uninsured."
